  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "5b3388c4-490e-546c-845e-24961af02baf",
      "document_id": "3ba9f201-9545-502b-8d6b-686913b6496b",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "Aspiration is the flame of the soul turned toward the light. It rises from the heart of the seeker and does not depend on outer circumstances.",
      "language_tag": "en",
      "chunk_type": "prose",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        640.0,
        540.0,
        700.0
      ],
      "iast_text": null,
      "sanskrit_glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7ff34425-8c66-5700-8e9b-c001d1f667d1",
      "document_id": "3ba9f201-9545-502b-8d6b-686913b6496b",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "Surrender is the offering of the whole nature to the divine will. In surrender the seeker gives up the demand of the ego and trusts a greater guidance.",
      "language_tag": "en",
      "chunk_type": "prose",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        640.0,
        540.0,
        700.0
      ],
      "iast_text": null,
      "sanskrit_glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "208c5280-326f-5006-94f3-7fe7ea03e0d2",
      "document_id": "3ba9f201-9545-502b-8d6b-686913b6496b",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "page_number": 3,
      "text": "Consciousness has many planes, and the integral yoga seeks to bring the higher consciousness down into the physical life so that it is transformed.",
      "language_tag": "en",
      "chunk_type": "prose",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        640.0,
        540.0,
        700.0
      ],
      "iast_text": null,
      "sanskrit_glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "98b033f8-4769-5528-926e-adff0d10c5f9",
      "document_id": "52a7f07c-4e36-5b2c-b7c3-e17dd3d01baa",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "La transformation du corps demande une aspiration constante et un abandon total a la volonte divine. La conscience supérieure descend peu a peu dans la matiere.",
      "language_tag": "fr",
      "chunk_type": "prose",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        640.0,
        540.0,
        700.0
      ],
      "iast_text": null,
      "sanskrit_glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0c13bda4-9803-5c4f-a714-4f988235bfa7",
      "document_id": "52a7f07c-4e36-5b2c-b7c3-e17dd3d01baa",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "La patience est la compagne de la transformation: chaque cellule doit apprendre a recevoir la lumiere.",
      "language_tag": "fr",
      "chunk_type": "prose",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        640.0,
        540.0,
        700.0
      ],
      "iast_text": null,
      "sanskrit_glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4bef6114-a7e7-5ff6-88e6-75965256f7e8",
      "document_id": "658539ac-5f8e-53d5-ae8d-d090bb839d78",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "page_number": 1,
      "text": "ॐ तत् सत् । समर्पणं परमेश्वराय",
      "language_tag": "sa",
      "chunk_type": "poetry",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        600.0,
        400.0,
        640.0
      ],
      "iast_text": "oṃ tat sat | samarpaṇaṃ parameśvarāya",
      "sanskrit_glossary": {
        "samarpaṇa": "surrender, offering",
        "parameśvara": "the supreme lord"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14648ffd-79f1-5d20-9e53-5f3c131f1a7c",
      "document_id": "658539ac-5f8e-53d5-ae8d-d090bb839d78",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "A flame ascends in silence,\n  the heart a lamp of light;\nthe soul in quiet surrender\n  keeps vigil through the night.",
      "language_tag": "en",
      "chunk_type": "poetry",
      "bbox": [
        120.0,
        520.0,
        420.0,
        600.0
      ],
      "iast_text": null,
      "sanskrit_glossary": null
    }
  ],
